ub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>⇌</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></math><br />It is obtained by subtracting (i) from (ii), hence equilibrium constant of the required equation will be<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>.",
